{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "فَرَقْنَا", "translation": "We parted"}, {"text": "بِكُمُ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَحْرَ", "translation": "the sea"}, {"text": "فَأَنجَيْنَـٰكُمْ", "translation": "then We saved you"}, {"text": "وَأَغْرَقْنَآ", "translation": "and We drowned"}, {"text": "ءَالَ", "translation": "(the) people"}, {"text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translation": "(of) Firaun"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "while you"}, {"text": "تَنظُرُونَ", "translation": "(were) looking"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We parted the sea for you and saved you and drowned the people of Pharaoh while you were looking on."}